ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NORMAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the experianced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPOSSIBLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For all the psychos who do not fear to die thousands of times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/1930d10734b282a6262dee4f330d3966.apng?t=1740938281\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/1930d10734b282a6262dee4f330d3966.poster.avif?t=1740938281\" class=\"bb_img\" width=42 height=42 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/1930d10734b282a6262dee4f330d3966.apng?t=1740938281\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/1930d10734b282a6262dee4f330d3966.poster.avif?t=1740938281\" class=\"bb_img\" width=42 height=42 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/1930d10734b282a6262dee4f330d3966.apng?t=1740938281\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/1930d10734b282a6262dee4f330d3966.poster.avif?t=1740938281\" class=\"bb_img\" width=42 height=42 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/b24d9f1ac55c5bd8d091a2a40e51a2e8.webp?t=1740938281\" width=36 height=36 /></span> A hidden Speed Run Chamber where you can enter any stage of the game to check how good you are using a timer and death counter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You will need to quit the game once you enter the stage you want to speedrun and launch it again, because the counter starts with the game launch!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Oopsies for this moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/121049773d0aaa74f9701b0ffccd54aa.webp?t=1740938281\" width=36 height=36 /></span> If the game runs at 1 Frame Per Second, plug in your controller and restart your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/121049773d0aaa74f9701b0ffccd54aa.webp?t=1740938281\" width=36 height=36 /></span> The game crashes on its first launch, but you're good to go after that! The game might crash after finishing multiple levels in one sitting, but don't worry, your progress is saved! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222220/extras/121049773d0aaa74f9701b0ffccd54aa.webp?t=1740938281\" width=36 height=36 /></span> If you're using a gamepad controller, you need to use the keyboard &amp; mouse to pause the game and move around the menu. The default and prefered controller is keyboard with mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>What's so special about this game?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7WORLDS: The Dreaming Dale is made with Platfinity! A Legacy engine which is sadly not available anymore for sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hesitate to long! The Dreaming Dale is in danger and only Ronnie led by your decisions can save his beloved village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to be updated on what's going on with the game, please check my Facebook fanpage! I'm back at it and ready to finish this project! :D </p>","developers":["Green Dragon Art"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descri